WEBVTT

00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:04.670
Revelation is the most misread book in the Bible.

00:00:11.030 --> 00:00:14.870
Many people fear it. Others use it to predict the end.

00:00:21.060 --> 00:00:24.790
But John wrote it to call real people to stay faithful.

00:00:31.090 --> 00:00:34.040
This app walks through it, one step at a time.
